Unicode Unihan
  Provider: Unicode, Inc.
  Source: https://www.unicode.org/Public/
  Reading fields and variant relations are used for attestation and assembly.
  Transcribed readings are identified by basis=single, attested_by=unihan in
  tools/fold-han-provenance/<tier>.tsv for the corresponding <tier>.tsv table.
  Unicode License v3 is reproduced below. The generated Unihan tier also carries
  its own UNICODE-LICENSE.txt.

