OpenCC TSCharacters
  Provider: the OpenCC contributors.
  Source: https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC
  Reference commits and content checksums appear in provenance headers.
  Character relations are used to check and assemble variant families; they
  are not an independent reading lineage. Upstream source and license notices
  must accompany any distributed transcription as applicable.

Transcribed-file inventory
  The per-tier provenance sidecar and table basis counts identify the scope of
  transcription. Distribution preparation must enumerate the actual files that
  contain transcribed readings or mappings and retain their source notices.

